    <!-- "Can the hero walk here?" pictograms, one per writable
         CollisionPreset, named `collision-<preset>-symbolic`. Each draws
         the 16x16 tile frame (interior 3..13) at 55% opacity plus the
         blocked area solid: a half is 5px deep, a corner 5x5 — so the
         picture reads at icon size without a label. -->
