    <file preprocess="xml-stripblanks">icons/scalable/actions/collision-corner-bottom-right-symbolic.svg</file>
    <!-- "Where is it drawn?" pictures for a visual's depth choice: solid is
         the thing, faint is whatever else stands near it. Sorted shows a
         ladder where the lower block covers the one above; behind and
         in-front show the thing under / over a neighbour. -->
    <file preprocess="xml-stripblanks">icons/scalable/actions/depth-sorted-symbolic.svg</file>
